1
00:00:00,908 --> 00:00:03,498
"Section nine: Miscellany.

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:08,750
(Past Sheldon:)The apartment's flag is a gold lion
rampant on a field of azure."

3
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:11,250
(Past Leonard:)We have a flag?

4
00:00:21,553 --> 00:00:22,933
(Past Sheldon:)Never fly it upside down.

5
00:00:24,556 --> 00:00:26,186
(Past Sheldon:)Unless the apartment's in distress.

6
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:27,890
Fine, next.

7
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:30,690
"If either of us ever invents time travel...

8
00:00:30,854 --> 00:00:35,944
(Past Sheldon:)...we agree our first stop will be this
meeting today in precisely five seconds."

9
00:00:37,861 --> 00:00:39,651
(Penny:)Okay.

10
00:00:51,124 --> 00:00:53,294
(Past Sheldon:)Well, that's disappointing.

11
00:00:53,961 --> 00:00:56,591
(Penny:)Why on earth did you agree to all that?

12
00:00:56,755 --> 00:01:00,635
(Leonard:)It was the best apartment I'd seen,
the rent was very reasonable...

